lesson: 248
title: Feet, inches, yards, pounds and stone
level: primary-3
stars: 1
explain: A foot is 12 inches. Heights are often given in feet and inches, like 4 feet 6 inches.
explain: To turn a height into inches only, multiply the feet by 12 and add the extra inches.
explain: 4 feet 6 inches is 4 × 12 + 6 = 54 inches.
vars: a=name b=name f=3..5 i=2..11 z=2..9
answer: 12 * f + i
exercise: {a} is {f} feet {i} inches tall. How tall is {a.he} in inches?
exercise: A bookcase is {f} feet {i} inches high. How many inches high is it?
exercise: At the doctor's, {a} measures {f} ft {i} in. What is {a.his} height in inches?
exercise: A rope is {f} feet {i} inches long. How long is it in inches?
exercise: The door of {a}'s tree house is {f} feet {i} inches tall. How many inches is that?
exercise: {a}'s {f} foot {i}, how many inches is that
exercise: my lil bro is {f} ft {i+1}, no sorry {f} ft {i}. inches?
exercise: {a} got measured at school today, {f} feet {i} inches, beat {b} lol. how many inches tall
exercise: {b} says {f} feet {i} inches is {f*10+i} inches. pretty sure that's wrong, what is it really
exercise: the christmas tree is {f} ft {i} in y'all, how tall in inches
exercise: {a}'s snowman came out {f} feet {i} inches, how many inches
test: How many inches are there in a height of {f} feet {i} inches?
test: {a}'s rabbit hutch is {f} feet and {i} inches long. Give its length in inches only.
test: {a} is {f} feet {i} inches tall and {b} is {z} inches shorter than the door. What is {a}'s height in inches?
test: Write {f} ft {i} in as a number of inches.
test: {f} foot {i} in inches pls
test: sis is {f} feet {i} inches now, tall or what. how many inches
exam: Express in inches the stature of {a}, which is recorded as {f.words} feet and {i.words} inches.
exam: It is given that a beam measures {f} ft {i} in in length. Ascertain the said length expressed exclusively in inches.
exam: A height of {f} feet {i} inches having been recorded, state its equivalent in inches.
exam: Whereas a doorway is certified to be {f} feet {i} inches in height, compute its height in inches.
exercise: {a}'s little brother is small for his age, the doctor says, and he is {f} feet {i} inches tall. How tall is he in inches?
exercise: {b} calls {a} vertically challenged, cheeky sod, {a.he}'s {f} foot {i}. how many inches is that then?
test: The late Mr Hill's grandfather clock stands {f} feet {i} inches high. What is its height in inches?
